        "cooked": "<p>Well … two-woman army, really.</p>\n<p>Attempted, today, to take on Blade on standard mode in Megalopolis. Couldn’t get easier, right? Only used two heroes – Wraith and Visionary. Didn’t do too badly – managed to at least flip Blade – but failed to win. Another nephew has now been turned on to the game …</p>",
