        "created_at": "2011-12-06T15:54:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My two friends whom I regularly play SotM with and I took on Blade on advanced, and he beat us with his moon beam. It was actually surprising. I never thought I’d actually lose to Blade, even on advanced, but now at least the challenge has been presented. We were playing with Bunker, Ab-Zero, and Legacy.</p>",
